# An artifact's header: its title on the left, cut short and in full on hover, and its icons on the
# right, on a narrow desk and an expanded one.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
prefer themeId aura-noir
prefer starAsked true
replies pages-header.json
project storefront shop
patch pages-notes.diff
chat Wren
title "Cache the product pages"
say "Show me the stores side by side."
settle 10
front Wren
settle 2
click 1083,69
settle 4
snap pages-header-narrow
move 780,98
settle 2
snap pages-header-hover
move 780,400
settle 1
click 1092,63
settle 3
snap pages-header-wide
